# A lone Champion on an open board, deliberately NOT pre-bonded (unlike the other scenarios) —
# this is the one built to exercise the mandatory first bond (own tile) yourself, then expand
# the network outward hex by hex (any cell is bondable, D8/D9 revised 2026-08-08). Exercises
# Bond/AP/the once-per-turn `*` cost flavor without any other distraction. Also carries a small
# library so Draw is exercisable in the same scenario.
seed 4
board 4x4

card test.champion Champion "Champion" attack=2 life=15 ap=7 abilities=core.move,core.attack,champion.bond,champion.draw,champion.collapse
card test.grunt Creature "Grunt" attack=3 life=5 ap=3 mana=2 abilities=core.move,core.attack

champion P1 test.champion 0,0

library P1 test.grunt,test.grunt
